+PLX Technology OXNAS SoCs Family device tree bindings
+-------------------------------------------
+
+Boards with the OX810SE Soc SoC shall have the following properties:
+  Required root node property:
+    compatible: "plxtech,ox810se"
+
+Board compatible values:
+  - "wd,mbwe" (OX810SE)
